<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Lapzo · Reporte NPS Usuarios Finales · May–Jun 2026</title>
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/Chart.js/4.4.1/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/xlsx/0.18.5/xlsx.full.min.js"></script>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
/* ====== IDENTIDAD LAPZO — ajusta aquí los tokens exactos del brandbook ====== */
:root{
  --lz-primary:#6B3FF2;        /* Violeta Lapzo */
  --lz-primary-deep:#2A1659;   /* Violeta tinta (encabezados) */
  --lz-primary-soft:#EDE7FD;   /* Lavanda de fondo */
  --lz-accent:#21C4B5;         /* Acento turquesa */
  --lz-ink:#1E1B2E;
  --lz-muted:#6E6A85;
  --lz-bg:#F7F5FC;
  --lz-card:#FFFFFF;
  --lz-line:#E5E0F3;
  /* Semáforo NPS solicitado */
  --nps-det:#E5484D;           /* Detractores (0–6) */
  --nps-pas:#F2B707;           /* Pasivos (7–8) */
  --nps-pro:#2FA86B;           /* Promotores (9–10) */
  --radius:16px;
  --shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(42,22,89,.07);
  --font-display:'Sora',sans-serif;
  --font-body:'Inter',sans-serif;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:var(--font-body);background:var(--lz-bg);color:var(--lz-ink);font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}

/* ====== Header ====== */
header.top{background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--lz-primary-deep) 0%,#46248F 55%,var(--lz-primary) 100%);color:#fff;padding:28px 32px 22px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
header.top::after{content:"";position:absolute;right:-80px;top:-90px;width:320px;height:320px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,255,255,.14),transparent 70%)}
.brandrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.logo{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.5px;background:#fff;color:var(--lz-primary-deep);padding:4px 14px;border-radius:10px}
.logo span{color:var(--lz-primary)}
.htitle h1{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:21px;letter-spacing:-.3px}
.htitle p{opacity:.82;font-size:13px;margin-top:2px}
.hbadges{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hbadge{background:rgba(255,255,255,.13);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);border-radius:12px;padding:8px 16px;text-align:center;backdrop-filter:blur(4px)}
.hbadge b{display:block;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:22px;line-height:1.1}
.hbadge small{font-size:11px;opacity:.85;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px}

/* ====== Tabs ====== */
nav.tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;padding:0 32px;background:var(--lz-primary-deep);overflow-x:auto}
nav.tabs button{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px;border:none;cursor:pointer;background:transparent;color:rgba(255,255,255,.65);padding:13px 18px 12px;border-bottom:3px solid transparent;white-space:nowrap}
nav.tabs button.active{color:#fff;border-bottom-color:var(--lz-accent)}
nav.tabs button:hover{color:#fff}

/* ====== Filters ====== */
#filterbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;background:var(--lz-card);border-bottom:1px solid var(--lz-line);padding:12px 32px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(42,22,89,.05)}
.fb-row{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
.fb-label{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:12px;color:var(--lz-primary-deep);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.8px;margin-right:4px}
.ms{position:relative}
.ms>button{border:1.5px solid var(--lz-line);background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:7px 12px;font-size:12.5px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--lz-ink);font-family:var(--font-body);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.ms>button:hover{border-color:var(--lz-primary)}
.ms>button.on{background:var(--lz-primary-soft);border-color:var(--lz-primary);color:var(--lz-primary-deep);font-weight:600}
.ms .count{background:var(--lz-primary);color:#fff;border-radius:999px;font-size:10.5px;padding:1px 7px;font-weight:700}
.ms .panel{display:none;position:absolute;top:calc(100% + 6px);left:0;z-index:80;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--lz-line);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);min-width:230px;max-width:320px;max-height:320px;overflow:auto;padding:8px}
.ms.open .panel{display:block}
.ms .panel input[type=search]{width:100%;padding:6px 9px;border:1px solid var(--lz-line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:12.5px}
.ms .opt{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:5px 7px;border-radius:7px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12.5px}
.ms .opt:hover{background:var(--lz-primary-soft)}
.ms .opt input{accent-color:var(--lz-primary)}
.ms .opt .n{margin-left:auto;color:var(--lz-muted);font-size:11px}
.ms .acts{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:6px}
.ms .acts button{flex:1;border:none;background:var(--lz-primary-soft);color:var(--lz-primary-deep);border-radius:7px;padding:4px;font-size:11px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}
.fb-dates{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--lz-muted)}
.fb-dates input{border:1.5px solid var(--lz-line);border-radius:10px;padding:6px 8px;font-size:12.5px;font-family:var(--font-body)}
#comSearch{border:1.5px solid var(--lz-line);border-radius:10px;padding:7px 12px;font-size:12.5px;width:190px}
#clearF{border:none;background:var(--lz-primary-deep);color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 14px;font-size:12.5px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}
#clearF:hover{background:var(--lz-primary)}
#activeInfo{font-size:12px;color:var(--lz-muted);margin-left:auto}
#activeInfo b{color:var(--lz-primary-deep)}

/* ====== Layout ====== */
main{padding:24px 32px 60px;max-width:1480px;margin:0 auto}
.tabpane{display:none}.tabpane.active{display:block}
.grid{display:grid;gap:18px}
.g-kpi{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(170px,1fr))}
.g-2{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
.g-3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
@media(max-width:980px){.g-2,.g-3{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.card{background:var(--lz-card);border:1px solid var(--lz-line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:18px 20px}
.card h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:14.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--lz-primary-deep);margin-bottom:4px}
.card .sub{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--lz-muted);margin-bottom:12px}
.kpi{text-align:left;border-top:4px solid var(--lz-primary)}
.kpi.det{border-top-color:var(--nps-det)}.kpi.pas{border-top-color:var(--nps-pas)}.kpi.pro{border-top-color:var(--nps-pro)}.kpi.base{border-top-color:var(--lz-accent)}
.kpi b{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:30px;display:block;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-1px}
.kpi small{font-size:11px;color:var(--lz-muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.7px;font-weight:600}
.kpi .pct{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--lz-muted);margin-top:2px;display:block}
.chartbox{position:relative;height:280px}
.chartbox.tall{height:340px}
.section-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:19px;color:var(--lz-primary-deep);margin:30px 0 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.section-title::before{content:"";width:8px;height:26px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(var(--lz-primary),var(--lz-accent))}
.note{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--lz-muted);margin-top:10px}

/* ====== Tables ====== */
.tablewrap{overflow:auto;max-height:520px;border:1px solid var(--lz-line);border-radius:12px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px}
thead th{position:sticky;top:0;background:var(--lz-primary-deep);color:#fff;text-align:left;padding:9px 11px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.3px;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;user-select:none}
thead th .arr{opacity:.6;font-size:10px}
tbody td{padding:8px 11px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--lz-line);vertical-align:top}
tbody tr:hover{background:var(--lz-primary-soft)}
.pill{display:inline-block;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#fff}
.pill.det{background:var(--nps-det)}.pill.pas{background:var(--nps-pas);color:#4a3a00}.pill.pro{background:var(--nps-pro)}
.npsval{font-weight:700;font-family:var(--font-display)}
.prodtag{display:inline-block;background:var(--lz-primary-soft);color:var(--lz-primary-deep);border-radius:6px;padding:1px 7px;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;margin:1px}
.pager{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--lz-muted)}
.pager button{border:1px solid var(--lz-line);background:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:5px 11px;cursor:pointer}
.pager button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default}
.minbase{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:12px;color:var(--lz-muted)}
.minbase input{accent-color:var(--lz-primary)}

/* ====== Infografía ====== */
.info-hero{background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--lz-primary-deep),var(--lz-primary));color:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:28px;margin-bottom:20px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.info-hero::after{content:"";position:absolute;right:-60px;bottom:-100px;width:260px;height:260px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
.info-hero h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:24px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.5px}
.info-hero p{opacity:.85;margin-top:4px;font-size:13px}
.segcard{border-radius:var(--radius);padding:20px;color:#fff;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.segcard h4{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:16px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.segcard .dot{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff}
.segcard ul{list-style:none;margin:12px 0}
.segcard li{padding:3px 0 3px 18px;position:relative;font-size:13px}
.segcard li::before{content:"›";position:absolute;left:2px;font-weight:800}
.segcard .plan{background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);border-radius:10px;padding:9px 12px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;margin-top:6px}
.segcard.det{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#C03338,var(--nps-det))}
.segcard.pas{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#C99A00,var(--nps-pas));color:#3a2e00}
.segcard.pas .plan{background:rgba(255,255,255,.45)}
.segcard.pro{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#1F7F4E,var(--nps-pro))}
.quote{background:var(--lz-primary-soft);border-left:5px solid var(--lz-primary);border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 20px;font-size:14.5px;font-style:italic;color:var(--lz-primary-deep);margin:14px 0}
.starrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid var(--lz-line);border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:8px;background:#fff}
.starrow .nm{flex:1;font-weight:600;font-size:13px}
.starrow .imp{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 10px}
.imp.ma{background:#FBE3E4;color:#9d2126}.imp.a{background:#FCEFC7;color:#7a5d00}.imp.m{background:#DBF3E7;color:#1F7F4E}
.stars{letter-spacing:2px;font-size:14px}
.prio{border-radius:var(--radius);padding:18px;color:#fff}
.prio h4{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:14px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:8px}
.prio ul{list-style:none}.prio li{font-size:12.5px;padding:3px 0 3px 16px;position:relative}
.prio li::before{content:"•";position:absolute;left:2px}
.prio.p1{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#C03338,var(--nps-det))}
.prio.p2{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#D97706,#F59E0B)}
.prio.p3{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#1F7F4E,var(--nps-pro))}
details.det-an{border:1px solid var(--lz-line);border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:10px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden}
details.det-an summary{cursor:pointer;padding:13px 16px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--lz-primary-deep);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;list-style:none}
details.det-an summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
details.det-an summary .chev{margin-left:auto;transition:transform .2s;color:var(--lz-primary)}
details.det-an[open] summary .chev{transform:rotate(90deg)}
.det-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:0;border-top:1px solid var(--lz-line)}
@media(max-width:980px){.det-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.det-col{padding:14px 16px;font-size:12.5px}
.det-col+.det-col{border-left:1px solid var(--lz-line)}
.det-col h5{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.7px;color:var(--lz-muted);margin-bottom:7px;font-family:var(--font-display)}
.det-col ul{list-style:none}.det-col li{padding:2px 0 2px 14px;position:relative}
.det-col li::before{content:"–";position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--lz-primary)}
.det-col.dolor li::before{color:var(--nps-det)}
.det-col.ini li::before{content:"✓";color:var(--nps-pro)}
.hall{display:flex;gap:14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--lz-line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:18px;margin-bottom:12px}
.hall .num{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:26px;color:var(--lz-primary);min-width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--lz-primary-soft);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.uxmed{border-radius:var(--radius);padding:18px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--lz-line);border-top:5px solid var(--lz-primary)}
.uxmed.good{border-top-color:var(--nps-pro)}
.uxmed.bad{border-top-color:var(--nps-det)}
.uxmed h4{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:6px}
.concl{background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--lz-primary-deep),#46248F);color:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:24px}
.concl h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:17px;margin-bottom:10px}
.concl .big{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.6;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-left:4px solid var(--lz-accent);padding:12px 16px;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;margin-top:12px}
.tagchip{display:inline-block;background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);border-radius:999px;padding:4px 13px;font-size:12px;margin:3px 4px 0 0}
footer{padding:18px 32px;text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--lz-muted)}
@media(max-width:760px){header.top,main,#filterbar,nav.tabs{padding-left:16px;padding-right:16px}.hbadges{margin-left:0}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="top">
  <div class="brandrow">
    <div class="logo">lapzo<span>.</span></div>
    <div class="htitle">
      <h1>Reporte NPS · Usuarios finales</h1>
      <p id="subTitle">Encuesta in-app (PostHog) · Respuestas del 27 may al 09 jun 2026</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hbadges">
      <div class="hbadge"><b id="hbNps">—</b><small>NPS global</small></div>
      <div class="hbadge"><b id="hbBase">—</b><small>Respuestas</small></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="tabs">
  <button class="active" data-tab="resumen">Resumen NPS · Base cruda</button>
  <button data-tab="calculos">Cálculos</button>
  <button data-tab="verbal">Análisis de Verbalizaciones</button>
</nav>

<div id="filterbar">
  <div class="fb-row" style="margin-bottom:10px;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--lz-line)">
    <span class="fb-label">Datos</span>
    <button id="btnUpload" type="button" style="border:none;background:var(--lz-primary);color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 16px;font-size:12.5px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">📂 Actualizar desde Excel</button>
    <input type="file" id="xlsxInput" accept=".xlsx,.xlsm,.xls" style="display:none">
    <span id="dataStatus" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--lz-muted)">Datos embebidos · corte al 19/06/2026 · 2,072 respuestas</span>
  </div>
  <div class="fb-row">
    <span class="fb-label">Filtros</span>
    <div id="msContainer" style="display:contents"></div>
    <div class="fb-dates">
      <span>Fecha</span>
      <input type="date" id="fDesde">
      <span>→</span>
      <input type="date" id="fHasta">
    </div>
    <input type="search" id="comSearch" placeholder="Buscar en comentarios…">
    <button id="clearF">Limpiar filtros</button>
    <span id="activeInfo"></span>
  </div>
</div>

<main>

<!-- ================= TAB 1: RESUMEN ================= -->
<section class="tabpane active" id="tab-resumen">
  <div class="grid g-kpi">
    <div class="card kpi"><small>Net Promoter Score</small><b id="kNps">—</b><span class="pct" id="kNpsSub"></span></div>
    <div class="card kpi base"><small>Base de respuestas</small><b id="kBase">—</b><span class="pct" id="kBaseSub"></span></div>
    <div class="card kpi pro"><small>Promotores (9–10)</small><b id="kPro">—</b><span class="pct" id="kProPct"></span></div>
    <div class="card kpi pas"><small>Pasivos (7–8)</small><b id="kPas">—</b><span class="pct" id="kPasPct"></span></div>
    <div class="card kpi det"><small>Detractores (0–6)</small><b id="kDet">—</b><span class="pct" id="kDetPct"></span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid g-2" style="margin-top:18px">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Composición del NPS</h3>
      <div class="sub">Distribución de evaluadores por segmento</div>
      <div class="chartbox"><canvas id="chDonut"></canvas></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Distribución de calificaciones (0–10)</h3>
      <div class="sub">Cada barra se colorea según su segmento NPS</div>
      <div class="chartbox"><canvas id="chDist"></canvas></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
    <h3>Evolución diaria</h3>
    <div class="sub">Respuestas por segmento (barras apiladas) y NPS del día (línea)</div>
    <div class="chartbox tall"><canvas id="chTrend"></canvas></div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid g-3" style="margin-top:18px">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Por medio de contacto</h3>
      <div class="sub">% del segmento · etiqueta = NPS</div>
      <div class="chartbox"><canvas id="chMedio"></canvas></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Por navegador</h3>
      <div class="sub">% del segmento · etiqueta = NPS</div>
      <div class="chartbox"><canvas id="chNav"></canvas></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Por país</h3>
      <div class="sub">% del segmento · etiqueta = NPS</div>
      <div class="chartbox"><canvas id="chPais"></canvas></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
    <h3>Respuestas individuales</h3>
    <div class="sub">Base cruda PostHog filtrada · clic en encabezados para ordenar</div>
    <div class="tablewrap"><table id="tblBase">
      <thead><tr>
        <th data-k="fecha">Fecha <span class="arr"></span></th>
        <th data-k="cli">Cliente <span class="arr"></span></th>
        <th data-k="nps">NPS <span class="arr"></span></th>
        <th data-k="tipo">Segmento <span class="arr"></span></th>
        <th data-k="pais">País <span class="arr"></span></th>
        <th data-k="medio">Medio <span class="arr"></span></th>
        <th data-k="nav">Navegador <span class="arr"></span></th>
        <th data-k="est">Estatus <span class="arr"></span></th>
        <th>Productos</th>
        <th data-k="com">Comentario <span class="arr"></span></th>
      </tr></thead>
      <tbody></tbody>
    </table></div>
    <div class="pager">
      <span id="pgInfo"></span>
      <button id="pgPrev">‹ Anterior</button>
      <button id="pgNext">Siguiente ›</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= TAB 2: CÁLCULOS ================= -->
<section class="tabpane" id="tab-calculos">
  <div class="note" style="margin-bottom:14px">Esta sección reproduce los cálculos de la pestaña «Cálculos» del archivo y responde a los mismos filtros globales, recalculándose en vivo a partir de la base cargada (NPS = %Promotores − %Detractores).</div>

  <div class="grid g-2">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>NPS por medio de contacto</h3>
      <div class="sub">NPS = %Promotores − %Detractores · color según rango (rojo &lt;0 · ámbar 0–49 · verde ≥50)</div>
      <div class="chartbox"><canvas id="ccMedio"></canvas></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>NPS por navegador empleado</h3>
      <div class="sub">Ordenado de mayor a menor</div>
      <div class="chartbox"><canvas id="ccNav"></canvas></div>
    </div>
